            "text": "{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The conversation history before this point was compacted into the following summary:\\n\\n<summary>\\n## Goal\\n1. Get the current weather in Tokyo using `get_weather` and answer in one short sentence. (Completed)\\n2. Call `get_weather` for Tokyo and Paris in parallel, in one step, then compare them in one sentence. (Partially completed: the Paris call failed.)\\n\\n## Constraints & Preferences\\n- Use the `get_weather` tool for weather data.\\n- Answers should be one short sentence.\\n- For the comparison, both calls must be made in parallel in a single step.\\n\\n## Progress\\n### Done\\n- [x] Called `get_weather(city=\\\"Tokyo\\\")`, which returned \\\"Tokyo: clear25°C, wind 10 km/h\\\". Answered: \\\"It's clear in Tokyo right now, 25°C with a 10 km/h wind.\\\"\\n- [x] Made parallel calls `get_weather(city=\\\"Tokyo\\\")` and `get_weather(city=\\\"Paris\\\")` in one step.\\n- [x] Told the user the comparison couldn't be done because Paris data was unavailable, and restated Tokyo's weather.\\n\\n### In Progress\\n- [ ] Tokyo vs. Paris weather comparison, which is incomplete because no Paris data was returned.\\n\\n### Blocked\\n- Paris weather lookup failed with the error: \\\"Weather service unavailable for Paris\\\".\\n\\n## Key Decisions\\n- **Did not fabricate Paris data**: The service failed, so the assistant reported the failure instead of guessing, and gave Tokyo's data alone.\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n1. Wait for the user's direction, such as retrying Paris or dropping the comparison.\\n2. If asked to retry, call `get_weather` for Paris (and Tokyo, in parallel, if a fresh comparison is wanted), then compare them in one sentence.\\n\\n## Critical Context\\n- Tokyo weather (returned twice, consistent): clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h. The raw tool output was \\\"Tokyo: clear25°C, wind 10 km/h\\\", with no space between \\\"clear\\\" and \\\"25°C\\\".\\n- Paris error message: \\\"Weather service unavailable for Paris\\\".\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\\n\\n## Original Request\\nThe user asked for the current time in Tokyo. They wanted the assistant to use the `get_time` tool first and then give a brief answer.\\n\\n## Progress So Far\\n- The assistant called `get_time(city=\\\"Tokyo\\\")`.\\n- The tool returned: \\\"Tokyo: 09:00\\\".\\n\\n## Context Needed to Continue\\n- The current time in Tokyo, per the tool result, is 09:00.\\n- The user asked for a brief answer.\\n- The final answer had not yet been given to the user in these messages.\\n</summary>\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It's 09:00 in Tokyo.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Is that warm? One word.\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I'm working out what \\\"that\\\" refers to, which looks like the Tokyo weather at 25°C. I'll settle on a one-word answer, either \\\"Yes.\\\" or \\\"Warm.\\\"\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yes.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Should I bring an umbrella? One word.\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I'm checking whether Tokyo is clear, and the answer is no.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"No.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Thanks. One word.\",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}}],\"max_tokens\":128000,\"stream\":true,\"system\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You are a weather assistant. Answer bri